ShortDescription: Fast native PostgreSQL GUI with a safety-gated AI copilot
Description: |-
  Lucent is a native desktop client for PostgreSQL built with Rust, Tauri 2 and
  Svelte 5. It has connection profiles with keychain-backed credentials and SSH
  tunnelling, a schema browser, a SQL editor, a paged results grid with in-grid
  filtering and sorting, SQL notebooks, and CSV/JSON/INSERT export.

  Its AI copilot answers plain-English questions about your data. It is
  read-only by default: every INSERT/UPDATE/DELETE is gated behind an explicit
  approval flow, and queries run under a per-query timeout with blast-radius
  checks. Use your own OpenAI or Anthropic key, a local Ollama model, or an
  installed ACP coding agent. The schema index is built locally.
